    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Li'l Miss Vampire Can't Suck Right",
        "jpn": "ちゃんと吸えない吸血鬼ちゃん"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Luna Ishikawa is a dark and mysterious vampire—or so she'd like her new classmates to believe. The truth is, while she may be one of the not-so-mythical bloodsuckers, she doesn't really live up to the hype. She's short and clumsy, and she can't even suck blood properly! So when her classmate Tatsuta Ootori discovers her little “drinking problem,” he can't help but lend a hand. Can he nurse Luna from the small, timid animal she is into a fearsome creature of the night?!",
        "jpn": "転校生の石川月菜は吸血鬼。\r\nミステリアスな雰囲気と圧倒的な存在感を放つ彼女はクラスの人気者。\r\nモブ的存在の大鳥は、月菜と関わることはないと思っていたのだが、\r\nある日、彼女の秘密を知ってしまい……。\r\n勉強も運動もできるカッコいい吸血鬼の月菜は、\r\n実は血を吸うのがめっちゃ下手！？\r\n\r\nあなたもきっと、“ママ”になる――\r\n新感覚甘やかし餌付けコメディ！"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Chanto Suenai Kyuuketsuki-chan",
        "Chanto Suenai Kyūketsuki-chan",
        "Vampires Chan Can't Suck Properly",
        "Vampire-chan Can't Suck Properly"
    ],
